{"name": "Abyss Ring", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Embark on a Culinary Adventure into the Abyss!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/739302b329e4f4eaef1b332b1e735372.poster.avif?t=1783562851\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/739302b329e4f4eaef1b332b1e735372.webm?t=1783562851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/739302b329e4f4eaef1b332b1e735372.mp4?t=1783562851\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a thrilling survival roguelike where cooking monsters is the key to survival. In this unique dungeon-crawling experience, you must satisfy your hunger by turning defeated monsters into life-saving meals as you journey toward the deepest floor of a perilous, randomly generated dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/2acea1e3555ca04b0bd46801d9beb090.poster.avif?t=1783562851\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/2acea1e3555ca04b0bd46801d9beb090.webm?t=1783562851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/2acea1e3555ca04b0bd46801d9beb090.mp4?t=1783562851\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each floor presents new dangers, treasures, and challenges. The dungeon's procedurally generated design ensures no two playthroughs are ever the same. Adapt your strategy to unpredictable layouts, enemies, and surprises as you delve deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/686872bdc1d0301e88833e593bbf0906.poster.avif?t=1783562851\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/686872bdc1d0301e88833e593bbf0906.webm?t=1783562851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/686872bdc1d0301e88833e593bbf0906.mp4?t=1783562851\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your playstyle with over 200 types of equipment, from powerful weapons to rare artifacts that enhance your cooking and combat abilities. Experiment with unique combinations to discover the setup that best suits your survival needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/6aae47d62a551b36a9638d68da734517.poster.avif?t=1783562851\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/6aae47d62a551b36a9638d68da734517.webm?t=1783562851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/6aae47d62a551b36a9638d68da734517.mp4?t=1783562851\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All of this is brought to life with breathtaking, high-quality graphics that immerse you in the mysterious and dangerous world of the dungeon. Every monster, meal, and piece of gear is rendered with stunning detail, making your journey as visually captivating as it is challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you conquer the abyss, or will the dungeon claim you as its next victim? Gather your courage, sharpen your skills, and prepare for an adventure that blends survival, strategy, and culinary creativity like never before. The dungeon awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoyed playing the game or would like to support me, please use the \u201cBuy Me a Coffee\u201d link below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"306\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/5a8521b06f11f49e8474a96b3eed83c3.avif?t=1783562851\" width=\"1090\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras_big/07e1ca0d0875668ab0ceda0e22c047e9.avif?t=1783562851\" height=\"421\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/07e1ca0d0875668ab0ceda0e22c047e9.avif?t=1783562851\" width=\"800\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Survive, cook, and conquer!Cook monsters to stave off hunger in this roguelike as you reach the deepest floor. With 200+ equipment items and random dungeons, every run offers endless possibilities.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/09c1541d3c84ae29dbbe0f3aabfb93c64a2afbff/header.jpg?t=1783562851", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["RPG", "Action", "Roguelike", "Action Roguelike", "Dungeon Crawler", "Hack and Slash"], "developers": "Northern Studio LLC", "publishers": "Northern Studio LLC", "release_date": "Q3 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3401570", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc"